# Everything the build does not need. Keeping node_modules out matters most:
# pnpm's are symlink farms that mean nothing inside an image, and copying them
# is both slow and wrong.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.md
docs-draft
e2e
**/tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
